B.a7q=new A.a6(B.fM,["How do I register on Tamil Matrimony?","You can register by clicking on the 'Register' button on the homepage and filling out the required details. You'll need to provide your basic information, contact details, and set a password."],t.w)
B.a7o=new A.a6(B.fM,["Is it free to create a profile?","Yes, creating a profile and browsing through matches is absolutely free. You only pay for premium features like direct messaging or viewing contact details."],t.w)
B.a7m=new A.a6(B.fM,["How can I search for profiles?","Our advanced search allows you to filter profiles based on age, location, religion, caste, education, and occupation. You can access the search feature from the navigation bar."],t.w)
B.a7r=new A.a6(B.fM,["What if I forget my password?","You can reset your password by clicking on the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page. Follow the instructions to create a new password."],t.w)
B.a7p=new A.a6(B.fM,["How do you ensure profile authenticity?","We have a robust verification process for new profiles. Our moderation team reviews each profile to ensure genuine information and weed out fake accounts."],t.w)
B.a7n=new A.a6(B.fM,["Can I update my profile details later?","Yes, you can edit your profile at any time from your dashboard. Navigate to the 'My Profile' section and click on the 'Edit Profile' button."],t.w)
